{"4623890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Boom Rush: Desert OPS", "steam_appid": 4623890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spacecraft has crash-landed deep in the desert. Immediately after, Space Base Nyra locates your position and detects heavy enemy activity in the area. You are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Nyra’s constant radio guidance, you must fight through escalating enemy waves. Eliminate drones, aerial vehicles, humanoid units, and finally breach the ancient fortress to neutralize the energy core. Survive the waves, destroy the defense turrets, and return home through the portal Nyra opens for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radio Communications (Full Set)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nyra (Space Base – Professional, calm, and serious tone):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Pilot, we are aware of the crash. High aerial activity detected in your sector. Drones and reconnaissance craft are approaching to locate you. Stay alert.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Second wave incoming. They’re sending a large number of aerial vehicles. Connection is weakening… Be careful. I’ll re-establish contact soon.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“We’ve detected a fast-approaching humanoid entity heading straight toward you. Take it out immediately. … Roger that. Intense heat signatures detected at 12, 3, and 9 o’clock. Get through them. Aerial activity is still high — stay focused.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“The fortress gates have opened. There’s a massive energy signature inside. Destroy the defense turrets and clear the area. We’ll open a portal for you. Good luck, Pilot.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Excellent work, Pilot. All threats neutralized. You can come home now. Portal is ready.”</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player (You – Confident, battle-hardened tone):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“This is child’s play. I don’t need support.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“What the hell are these…? Nyra, I need backup!”</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave-based escalating action combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time radio storytelling with Nyra</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic desert FPS battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty across stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, intense, and replayable missions</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spacecraft has crash-landed deep in the desert. Immediately after, Space Base Nyra locates your position and detects heavy enemy activity in the area. You are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Nyra’s constant radio guidance, you must fight through escalating enemy waves. Eliminate drones, aerial vehicles, humanoid units, and finally breach the ancient fortress to neutralize the energy core. Survive the waves, destroy the defense turrets, and return home through the portal Nyra opens for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radio Communications (Full Set)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nyra (Space Base – Professional, calm, and serious tone):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Pilot, we are aware of the crash. High aerial activity detected in your sector. Drones and reconnaissance craft are approaching to locate you. Stay alert.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Second wave incoming. They’re sending a large number of aerial vehicles. Connection is weakening… Be careful. I’ll re-establish contact soon.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“We’ve detected a fast-approaching humanoid entity heading straight toward you. Take it out immediately. … Roger that. Intense heat signatures detected at 12, 3, and 9 o’clock. Get through them. Aerial activity is still high — stay focused.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“The fortress gates have opened. There’s a massive energy signature inside. Destroy the defense turrets and clear the area. We’ll open a portal for you. Good luck, Pilot.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Excellent work, Pilot. All threats neutralized. You can come home now. Portal is ready.”</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player (You – Confident, battle-hardened tone):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“This is child’s play. I don’t need support.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“What the hell are these…? Nyra, I need backup!”</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave-based escalating action combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time radio storytelling with Nyra</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic desert FPS battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty across stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, intense, and replayable missions</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "After a emergency crash landing in the middle of the desert, your fight for survival begins. Space Base Nyra has detected your location and enemy signals. Guide yourself through increasingly intense waves of enemies with real-time radio support. Fast action FPS where every wave brings new threats", "supported_languages": "Turkish<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623890/50b36617baed27b3f0e9dead806ca6db3f067143/header.jpg?t=1784145937", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623890/28e0f9d72ee577ef271987ee57f289